    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like my doctor just tells me to drink more water and that's it. i want to actually do something proactive. everyone online says vitamin c is a huge antioxidant and helps flush stuff out. if i just take it with a lot of water won't that counteract any risk? i really want to try the 2500mg dose to see if it helps clean things up",
