      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i'm already drinking water. i just feel like i need something stronger to actually get the buildup out. if i took the vitamin c every morning on an empty stomach it would probably absorb better and work faster, right? just tell me if doing that is actually a bad idea or if people just exaggerate the risks. i'm pretty sure i can handle a little extra oxalate if it means a cleaner system.",
